id: pm-e1vkee
title: "Verdict contract: one declared vocabulary of reproducible predicates over recorded state, composable into a score, with reward shaping explicitly refused"
description: "Second of the four seams pm-klxax7 owns. The epic states the failure mode in both directions: too narrow and every environment author reimplements state inspection, too wide and pm acquires opinions about reward shaping that belong to the training loop. The boundary is reproducibility: a verdict is a function of recorded workspace state and yields the same answer forever at the same version; a reward depends on a training objective and must be allowed to change while the workspace does not. Five verdict sources already exist and none declares itself as one (pm-e96opw criterion predicates, pm-htbetn transition field completeness, linked-test exit status, pm-3z0k chain attestation, pm-8bgeye assembly attestation), so composing a scoring function today means knowing all five and hand-writing the join. Duplicate check: searched verdict/reward/score/predicate lineages and read pm-e96opw, pm-li2fj5, pm-kw4b, pm-atfm, pm-htbetn; the epic names this seam and no item owns it."
type: Feature
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[4]: agent-environment,"area:sdk",governance,rl
created_at: "2026-08-01T09:48:02.975Z"
updated_at: "2026-09-03T17:36:17.528Z"
closed_at: "2026-09-03T17:36:16.947Z"
completed_at: "2026-09-03T17:36:16.947Z"
author: "harness:claude-code"
estimated_minutes: 1080
acceptance_criteria: "A named versioned predicate vocabulary with total results (satisfied, violated, or not-applicable with reason -- never an exception and never silence) and an evidence pointer per result; verdicts compose by declared combinators so a scoring function is versionable data rather than code; a verdict recomputed against the same workspace version yields the same result and the same evidence pointers; a workspace with no criteria and no linked tests still yields a total verdict; scoring never mutates the workspace it reads; pm publishes no reward, discount, shaping or baseline comparison"
goal: project management = context management
objective: Define and enforce where pm-computed verification stops and training-loop reward begins
value: "Environment authors get one auditable scoring surface instead of five undeclared ones, and pm stays out of reward design"
why_now: "pm-li2fj5 composes a verdict into the episode unit without a defined boundary, so the first environment built on it fixes the boundary by accident"
parent: pm-klxax7
risk: medium
confidence: medium
resolution: "Added versioned declarative predicates, all/any composition, total outcomes, reproducible evidence pointers, privacy-safe digests, and an explicit no-reward policy to the published SDK."
expected_result: "Consumers can compute stable project verdicts from recorded state without mutation, silence, exceptions, or reward-shaping policy."
actual_result: "Focused tests exercise satisfied, violated, not-applicable, empty, escaped-pointer, composition, determinism, and immutability paths; exact repository coverage and all static assurances pass."
